    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "When quality and luxury combine you get No.4 Mountain view, an architecturally designed property situated within a private gated development within minutes’ drive of Kenmare town. \r\n\r\nThe development which was constructed in c. 2007 is completed to very high standards with quality finishes both inside and out. \r\n\r\nEach of the 13 properties within this development are positioned to maximise the views and take advantage of the maturing gardens. \r\n\r\nThe houses are accessed via a private gated entrance and drive adding to the exclusivity of the area. \r\n\r\nExternal gardens and lawns are landscaped with native trees including Mountain Ash, Birch and Dogwood and all houses have natural tree line boundaries and natural hedgerow type partitions between gardens. Driveway and entry paths are illuminated by wood bollards with soft down-lighting effect. \r\n\r\nZoned Gas fired central heating with heated towel rails in bathroom and en-suites. \r\n\r\nContents not included in the sale.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of four bedrooms (all en-suite), kitchen/dining room, living room, utility and main bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: Bright spacious entrance hall - Blue/Grey Jura limestone floor with oiled white oak stairs leading to first floor. \r\n\r\nLiving area: 4.6 M x 5.7 M - Solid white oak wooden flooring, Honed Kilkenny limestone fire place and hearth. Suitable for open fire but also plumbed for gas fire. Pre-wired for surround sound system. Patio doors opening on to patio area. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area: 4.5 M x 4.5 M - Tiled and solid white oak floor, fully fitted kitchen with built in appliances, cooker, hob, American fridge. Absolute black granite work tops. Utility: - Rear access, work top space, sink, washing machine, dryer \r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.9 M x 1.7 M - Fully tiled with beige Jura limestone floor and wall tiles Catalano wc & whb. Bette bath with shower over. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.9 M x3.5 M - Built in wardrobes, patio doors leading outside\r\nEn-suite: 2.3 M x 1.5 M - Tiled with beige Jura limestone tiles. Catalano wc & whb and Illusion showers \r\n\r\nFirst Floor: \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.5 M x 3.9 M - built in wardrobe \r\nEn-suite: 2.5 M x 1.5 M - Tiled with beige Jura limestone tiles. Catalano wc & whb and Illusion shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.2 M x 3.9 M - built in wardrobe \r\nEn-suite: 2.0 M x 1.7 M - Tiled with beige Jura limestone tiles. Catalano wc & whb and Illusion shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 4.2 M x 3.0 M - Built in wardrobe and balcony area. \r\nEn-suite: 2.0 M x 1.9 M -Tiled with beige Jura limestone tiles. Catalano wc & whb and Illusion shower"
      },
